At the moment I can't come up with anything ingenious. How about not 
starving so quickly but going to the fainting phase as normal? That is, 
the Convict can survive longer without starving but still having the 
normal hunger penalties. The flavor could be something like being used to 
tolerate hunger in harsh prison conditions.

This would make the hunger still be very dangerous but it won't force you 
to pray too early if you can't find food immediately.

